					<![CDATA[
						 <p>i feel that some of these are a bit off their mark. Other dimension University? Sure, they both are. But Deer is other dimensional in the same way the 3P is other dimensional. I.e. very rooted in baseline (Deer is even built on the ghosts of the founders of baseline Reed, not sure which “other dimension” they came from) and is an extra dimensional space for stuff. While alexylva is actually another (and seperate) dimension. And is a tad bit more Roman Empire than academy in my eyes.<br /> The library comparison is also a bit unfair, Deer is almost a part of the Portlands. And Anart is more than AWCY?.<br /> Well, I think deer has quite a lot of distinct qualities that makes it seperate from what you have mentioned.</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
