					<![CDATA[
						 <p><span style="text-decoration: line-through;">deer might not have a tag yet (COUGH COUGH) but it does have</span> deer now has a tag AND a got dam hub, complete with Even More World Building, as is my modus operandi.</p> <p>big ol thank you to <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/greenwolf" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1814684&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1560371133" alt="GreenWolf" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1814684)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/greenwolf" >GreenWolf</a></span> (<a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/finding-scalpel">Finding a Scalpel</a>) and <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/a-random-day" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1841781&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1560371133" alt="A Random Day" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1841781)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/a-random-day" >A Random Day</a></span> (<a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-3780">SCP-3780</a>) for taking a look at this.</p> <p><a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Complete_Guide_to_Heraldry_Fig390.png">image source</a> for the deer on the header image</p> <p>oh and the motto means &quot;Behold, Plato's Man&quot; and it's what Diogenes of Sinope shouted when he chucked a plucked chicken into the Academy after Plato defined &quot;Man&quot; as &quot;a featherless biped&quot;. well. he shouted it in Greek, but latin is more accessible because it at least uses the same alphabet as english.</p> 
				 	]]>
